OL,3,AMP criticises company ownership        
OL,4,Aregister plans                         
OL,6,FPlans to improve transparency over     
OL,7,Fcompany ownership in Guernsey and      
OL,8,FJersey have come under criticism from a
OL,9,FWestminster MP, who says they "do not  
OL,10,Fgo nearly far enough".                 
OL,12,FThe comments come after Guernsey and   
OL,13,FJersey set out plans to allow approved 
OL,14,Fapplicants access to information about 
OL,15,Fwho owns or controls companies when    
OL,16,Finvestigating suspected financial      
OL,17,Fcrime.                                 
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
