OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMP criticises company ownership        
OL,4,Aregister plans                         
OL,6,FSir Andrew Mitchell, who has campaigned
OL,7,Ffor greater scrutiny of company        
OL,8,Fownership, said there were "immediate  
OL,9,Findications" the proposals would fall  
OL,10,Fshort.                                 
OL,12,FHe said limits on access to the        
OL,13,Finformation could mean "national       
OL,14,Fsecurity threats may remain entirely   
OL,15,Finvisible to investigators".           
